          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>If you’re looking for a little more freedom in your day-to-day life, contact lenses can be a great option. Whether you’re working, staying active, or don’t love wearing glasses, contacts give you clear vision without anything getting in your way.</p><p>At <a href=\"/hours-location/\">Academy Vision</a>, we make it easy to find lenses that feel comfortable and fit naturally into your routine and life in Pine Beach.</p>",
          "id": "SrO01vbeA1",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
