          "text": "Type of Contact Lenses We Offer",
          "html": "Type of Contact Lenses We Offer",
          "id": "8iFobYT13E",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>There’s no one “right” type of contact lens—it all depends on what works best for your day-to-day life. Some people prefer the convenience of daily lenses, while others like longer-wear options, including trusted brands like Precision1® and Dailies Total1® from Alcon.</p><p>We’ll walk you through the choices and help you find something that fits comfortably into your routine without overcomplicating things.</p>",
          "id": "4yftkR3Odw",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
